        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And goeth down westward to the coast of Japhleti, unto the coast of Beth-horon the nether, and to Gezer: and the goings out thereof are at the sea.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
