        "reference": "Joshua 16:3",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "So the children of Joseph, Manasseh and Ephraim, took their inheritance.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "Josh. 17:4 (4, 14)."
